# Mosquitto ACL — SenseHub. Anything not granted here is denied.
# (Publishes to a denied topic are dropped; MQTT v5 clients get "Not authorized".)

# Irrigation monitor, farm 1021: its own subtree only (includes its LWT on farm/1021/status).
user farm1021
topic readwrite farm/1021/#

# SenseHub backend ingest: read-only on every farm. It cannot publish anything,
# so the ingest can never command a device through the broker.
user sensehub
topic read farm/#
